WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,040
twenty five minutes

2
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:03,440
You should be up in forty minutes at the latest

3
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:04,640
Let's wait a little longer

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:11,300
I just don’t know if I can fish it out. How did you get there?

5
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:12,660
Not asking you to send us a signal

6
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:13,660
Shall we pull you up?

7
00:00:17,110 --> 00:00:18,630
I've tied it up. You guys can pull it off.

8
00:00:18,790 --> 00:00:20,430
It only takes about twenty minutes to tie it up

9
00:00:20,510 --> 00:00:26,880
Quickly start the machine and it is indeed tied up.

10
00:00:33,740 --> 00:00:35,460
It's awesome. Come on, brother.

11
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:36,580
Change these clothes

12
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:37,540
Go into the office

13
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:39,540
Thank you for your hard work. I gave you some tea.

14
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:40,820
I have to give you money later

15
00:00:42,260 --> 00:00:46,690
Brother Xiao, you scared me to death. It’s okay.

16
00:00:46,690 --> 00:00:48,250
I told you I'm very hydrated

17
00:00:48,570 --> 00:00:51,940
Brother, please sign

18
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:53,820
This money has a provenance

19
00:00:53,820 --> 00:00:57,900
After you sign, you can take it away. Do you have a brush? A brush?
